### Enforced directory rules
> Active every session. Violations must be flagged immediately — do not silently accept drift.

| Directory | Owns | Must NOT contain |
|-----------|------|-----------------|
| `src/server/` | API routes, DB, auth, business logic | React components, browser APIs |
| `src/client/` | React components, CSS, browser code | Server-only code (fs, mysql, crypto.subtle for JWT) |
| `public/` | Static assets served directly | Source files, build artifacts |
| `dist/` | Build output (client bundle only) | Server entry point, source code |
| `scripts/` | Service management, deployment | Application logic |

