### Server — Core
| Symbol | File | Purpose |
|--------|------|---------|
| `pool` | `src/server/db.ts` | MySQL2 connection pool (10 connections, utf8mb4) |
| `ensureSchema()` | `src/server/db.ts` | Auto-creates/migrates all MySQL tables on server start (inc. fund_prices) |
| `closeDatabase()` | `src/server/db.ts` | Gracefully closes the MySQL pool |
| `queries.listInvestments(userId?)` | `src/server/db.ts` | Lists investments, optionally filtered by user |
