## 🎯 SESSION STATE

> **Overwrite every session. This is the primary hot-restart entry point.**

### Active objective
Multi-user investment fund tracker with full auth, hybrid data sourcing (Yahoo Finance + QueFondos for Spanish mutual funds), fund metadata enrichment, and WhatsApp notifications.

### Context
- Stack: Bun 1.3 + React 19 + Tailwind 4 + MySQL (XAMPP) + Yahoo Finance API + QueFondos scraper
- Server runs on port 3741, MySQL on 3306, database `fondtracker`, user `root`, no password
- Fund catalog seeded with ~490+ real European fund ISINs in MySQL `fund_catalog` table
- Auth: custom JWT (HMAC-SHA256, 7-day expiry), bcrypt passwords via Bun built-in
- Yahoo Finance works for ETFs (tickers like `IWDA.AS`, `VWCE.DE`). Mutual funds fall back to QueFondos scraper by ISIN
- ISIN-based tickers auto-discover via QueFondos first, then Yahoo (`.BC`/`.MC`/`.MA` suffixes)
- Fund metadata (TER, sectors, geography, top holdings) generated by `metadata.ts` based on fund profile heuristics
- Prices cached in `fund_prices` MySQL table to reduce API calls
- 3-tab FundCard: chart (interactive canvas with hover tooltip), composition (holdings/sectors/geography), details (TER, risk, returns 1Y/3Y/5Y)
- `src/server/fund-catalog.ts` is OBSOLETE — server uses MySQL `fund_catalog` table via `db.ts` queries
- `/api/banks` endpoint provides official URLs for 40+ Spanish banks/gestoras
- `/api/funds/:id` now supports PUT for editing investments
- **Routing**: `/` serves root `index.html` (static landing page with Tailwind CDN). `/dashboard`, `/login`, `/register` serve the React SPA. All other paths fall through to root `index.html`.
- **Landing page auth**: Root `index.html` has inline JS that checks `fondtracker_token` in localStorage, fetches `/api/auth/me`, and replaces header CTA with: Go to Dashboard (new tab), avatar (first letter of username), username text (sm+), settings gear dropdown (Change Email, Change Password, Sign Out, Delete Account — matching dashboard Header.tsx)

### Last action taken
Performance optimizations and request deduplication to prevent lag:
- Grouped portfolio investments by unique ISIN in `listInvestments` (`src/server/sentinel.ts`) so ticker discovery, price fetching and DB writes happen once per unique fund instead of once per transaction.
- Added in-memory cache with 5-minute TTL to `src/server/yahoo.ts` (`chartCache`) and `src/server/quefondos.ts` (`qfCache`).
- Added Request Coalescing using active promise maps (`activeCharts`, `activePrices`, `activeDiscoveries`, `activeScrapes`) to coalesce concurrent queries to Yahoo Finance/QueFondos.
- Landing page auth integration and settings dropdown:
  - Changed server route `/` to serve root `index.html` (static) instead of React SPA (`index`).
  - Added inline auth detection script to root `index.html`: reads `fondtracker_token` from localStorage, fetches `/api/auth/me`, replaces desktop CTA with: Go to Dashboard (opens in new tab), user avatar (first letter, green accent), username (sm+ breakpoint via `.sm-show` class), settings gear icon.
  - Settings dropdown matches dashboard `Header.tsx` exactly: "Signed in as" email, Change Email (inline subview with input + save), Change Password (inline subview with current/new inputs), Sign Out (redirect to /login), Delete Account (inline subview with password confirmation + irreversible warning).
  - Mobile CTA also replaced: Go to Dashboard + Sign Out when logged in.
  - Fixed CSS issues: `.sm-show` class added (display:none default, display:block on sm+), `@keyframes fadeIn` for dropdown animation. Must use `!important` on `.sm-show` to override inline `style="display:none"`.
  - CSP updated: added `https://assets.landinghero.app` to img-src, `https://cdn.tailwindcss.com` to script-src.
  - Added Tailwind theme variables to `styles.css` (@theme block: brand-primary, neutral-surface, shadows, glass-card, scroll animations).
  - (Previous: Premium glassmorphism auth redesign, dedicated routing, dynamic titles, sticky Header fix, mobile responsiveness, security hardening).

