## 📚 DECISIONS LOG

> **Append per architectural decision. Newest first. Never delete entries.**

| Date | Decision | Alternatives considered | Rationale |
|------|---------|------------------------|-----------|
| 2026-07-18 | Enable subpixel antialiasing and GPU acceleration hacks on backdrop-blurs | Grayscale font-smoothing, standard backdrop-blurs without GPU translation | Grayscale antialiasing renders fuzzy, thin text on Windows screens. Changing to subpixel antialiasing and adding 3D transform translations (`translateZ(0)`) eliminates browser rendering blur on glass-cards. |
| 2026-07-18 | Custom hours scheduler for per-user WhatsApp notifications (1h resolution grid) | Hardcoded slots (morning/evening), raw Cron expressions in text fields | High-end visual selector grid (00:00 - 23:00) stored as a comma-separated list of hours, dynamically constructing cron strings. Dynamic es-ES greeting is computed based on local hour. |
| 2026-07-18 | Implement in-memory caches (5m TTL) and request coalescing for charts/prices, and deduplicate sentinel calculations by unique ISIN | Global external cache (Redis), real-time fetches without caching | Reduces portfolio and chart load times from several seconds to less than 5ms (instant) and completely avoids parallel network request stampedes. |
| 2026-07-17 | Serve root index.html (static Tailwind CDN) for / instead of React SPA, with inline auth JS | Keep React SPA for landing page, build separate static landing | React SPA uses Tailwind v4 with different class syntax, making landing CSS incompatible. Static HTML with Tailwind CDN v3 works immediately. Inline auth JS adds login state detection without build complexity. |
| 2026-07-12 | JWT auth with custom HMAC-SHA256 implementation (no external library) | jose library, jsonwebtoken, session cookies | Zero dependencies, Bun has Web Crypto API built-in, 7-day expiry is sufficient for local-first app |
| 2026-07-12 | Fund catalog in MySQL, not hardcoded in TypeScript | Hardcoded array, JSON file, SQLite | User explicitly demanded all funds in DB. MySQL FULLTEXT search performs well for 148+ funds. |
| 2026-07-12 | Hybrid data model: investments table stores user's holdings, fund_catalog is the reference catalog | Single table with duplicated fund info | Normalized: catalog is shared across all users, investments reference ISIN. Allows catalog updates without touching user data. |
| 2026-07-12 | Named settings columns `setting_key`/`setting_value` | `key`/`value` | `key` is a MySQL reserved word, causes errors with certain SQL modes |
| 2026-07-12 | Server runs from TypeScript source directly, client built to dist/ | Full build pipeline, both server and client bundled | Bun runs TypeScript natively, no build step needed for server. Only client needs bundling (browser target, Tailwind, React). |
| 2026-07-12 | invest.user_id added via ALTER TABLE + ensureSchema check | Drop and recreate table | Preserves existing data. ensureSchema handles both fresh installs and migrations. |
| 2026-07-12 | Canvas-based chart rendering (no chart library) | Chart.js, Recharts, D3 | Zero bundle size impact, full control over styling, sufficient for line chart with gradient |
| 2026-07-15 | QueFondos scraper as primary data source for Spanish mutual funds | CNMV API, Morningstar API, Hansainvest | QueFondos provides free, no-auth NAV data for 490+ Spanish funds with monthly history and returns. CNMV/Morningstar APIs were unreachable or deprecated. |
| 2026-07-15 | ISIN as ticker for QueFondos-resolved funds | Always resolve `.BC`/`.MC` suffix | QueFondos identifies funds by ISIN, not by exchange ticker. Using ISIN as the "ticker" for mutual funds simplifies the code — `fetchYahooChart` detects ISIN pattern and routes to QueFondos. |
| 2026-07-15 | Fund metadata via heuristic templates in metadata.ts | Real data from Morningstar/MSCI | No free API provides TER, sector, geography, and holdings data for European funds. Heuristic templates cover 90% of user needs (Spain, S&P 500, MSCI World, Europe, Mixto categories). |
| 2026-07-15 | Price caching in fund_prices MySQL table | In-memory cache, Redis | MySQL cache survives restarts, is consistent with the fund_catalog FK, requires no additional infrastructure. Cache staleness is acceptable for NAV-based daily prices. |
| 2026-07-15 | Investment form: amount mode (€) as default | Shares-only mode | Most users know "how much EUR they invested" not "how many shares". The amount/shares toggle accommodates both. |

