## ❌ ERROR PATTERNS

> **Confirmed mistakes the AI has repeated across sessions. Read before writing code.**

| Symptom | Root cause | Correct approach |
|---------|-----------|-----------------|
| `curl` fails in PowerShell | PowerShell aliases `curl` to `Invoke-WebRequest` | Use `Invoke-RestMethod -Uri ...` or `curl.exe` (the real binary) |
| Server won't start: port in use | Previous bun process still alive on port 3741 | Kill by process name: `Get-Process -Name bun \| Stop-Process -Force` |
| `settings` table "Duplicate column" error | MySQL `ALTER TABLE ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS` not supported in all versions | Use `SHOW COLUMNS FROM ... LIKE 'colname'` check in `ensureSchema()` |
| `fund_catalog` table doesn't exist on seed | Running seed-funds.ts before ensureSchema() has run | Server must start once (runs ensureSchema) before seeding, or create table manually from schema-settings-catalog.sql |
| `< operator reserved` in PowerShell | PowerShell reserves `<` for future use | Pipe content: `Get-Content file.sql \| mysql.exe -u root db` |
| QueFondos returns `null` for some ISINs | ISIN not found in QueFondos database; page contains `{ISIN}` or `{NFONDO}` placeholder | The scraper correctly returns `null` — caller (`yahoo.ts`) falls through to Yahoo `.BC`/`.MC`/`.MA` suffixes automatically |
| Fund chart shows stale data after market hours | QueFondos publishes NAV after market close; Yahoo may have delayed data | The `isStale` flag and `staleWarning` badge alert users. Cached price in `fund_prices` remains valid. |
| `editInvestment` returns null | Investment not found or doesn't belong to user | Check user_id filter in `queries.getInvestment()` — always pass userId for authorization |
| `var fondo` JSON parse fails | QueFondos page format may change the JavaScript variable structure | The try/catch in `quefondos.ts` silently falls back to synthetic quotes from return data |

