## 🔐 SECURITY

### Auth model
- Method: JWT (HS256, HMAC-SHA256 via Web Crypto API)
- Token storage: `localStorage` (client-side)
- Lifetime: 7 days · Refresh strategy: none (re-login required)
- Auth middleware: `requireUser(req)` in `src/server/index.ts`
- Password hashing: bcrypt via `Bun.password.hash()` (built-in)

### Authorization
- Model: Per-user resource isolation
- Each investment has a `user_id` foreign key
- All queries filter by `user_id` — users can only see/edit/delete their own investments
- Fund catalog and Yahoo chart endpoints are public (no auth required)

### Sensitive data
| Data | Location | Storage | Encryption |
|------|----------|---------|-----------|
| Passwords | `users.password_hash` | MySQL | bcrypt (salted) |
| JWT secret | `JWT_SECRET` env var | Environment | N/A (HMAC key) |
| WhatsApp API key | `CALLMEBOT_API_KEY` env var / `settings` table | Env / MySQL | N/A (isolated per user) |
| WhatsApp Phone | `WHATSAPP_PHONE` env var / `users.phone` | Env / MySQL | N/A (isolated per user) |
| User emails | `users.email` | MySQL | Plaintext (local-first app) |

### Forbidden (in addition to CODE QUALITY gate)
- No raw SQL with user input (parameterized queries always — see `db.ts` queries)
- No auth checks client-side only (server validates JWT on every protected request)
- No secrets in committed files (.env only, gitignored)
- No verbose error messages to the client (log server-side, return generic)
- No passwords stored without bcrypt
- `JWT_SECRET` MUST be overridden in production
- No unvalidated phone numbers (must pass E.164 pattern `/^\+[1-9]\d{6,14}$/` before update)
- No email updates without current email verification

---

## 🔌 API CONTRACTS

### Endpoints
| Method | Path | Auth | Input | Output | Notes |
|--------|------|------|-------|--------|-------|
| GET | `/api/health` | No | — | `{ok, uptime, pid, platform, bun}` | Health check |
| POST | `/api/auth/register` | No | `{username, email, password}` | `{user: {id, username, email}, token}` | Creates user + returns JWT |
| POST | `/api/auth/login` | No | `{identifier, password}` | `{user: {id, username, email}, token}` | identifier = email or username |
| GET | `/api/auth/me` | **Yes** | — | `{id, username, email, created_at}` | User profile |
| GET | `/api/portfolio` | **Yes** | — | `{investments: [...], totals: {...}, status: {...}, platform}` | Unified payload with investments, stats, and WhatsApp config |
| GET | `/api/banks` | No | — | `{BankName: url, ...}` | 40+ Spanish bank/gestora fund search URLs |
| GET | `/api/funds/search` | No | `?q=&bank=&category=` | `{results: [...], total, banks, categories}` | Full-text fund catalog search (490+ funds) |
| GET | `/api/funds/catalog/:isin` | **Yes** | — | `{isin, name, bank, category, risk_level, currency, yahoo_ticker, base_price?, last_updated?}` | Single catalog entry |
| GET | `/api/funds/chart/:ticker` | **Yes** | `?range=1y&interval=1d` | `{symbol, currency, name, currentPrice, previousClose, weekHigh52, weekLow52, dataPoints, quotes: [...], dataDate?, isStale?, staleWarning?, dataSource?, verificationLog?, return1Y?, return3Y?, return5Y?, ter?, sectors?, geography?, topHoldings?}` | Chart data from Yahoo Finance or QueFondos, with extra metadata |
| POST | `/api/funds` | **Yes** | `{isin, shares, purchase_price, purchase_date, notes?}` | Investment object | Add investment |
| GET | `/api/funds/:id` | **Yes** | — | Investment object | Single investment |
| PUT | `/api/funds/:id` | **Yes** | `{shares, purchase_price, purchase_date, notes?}` | Updated investment object | Edit investment |
| DELETE | `/api/funds/:id` | **Yes** | — | `{ok: true}` | Delete investment |
| GET | `/api/notify/preview` | No | — | `{message, messages: [...]}` | Preview digest |
| POST | `/api/notify/test` | No | — | `{ok, message, sent}` | Send test digest |

### Core data models
```
Entity: User
  id            INT       AUTO_INCREMENT PK
  username      VARCHAR(100)  UNIQUE NOT NULL
  email         VARCHAR(255)  UNIQUE NOT NULL
  password_hash VARCHAR(255)  NOT NULL (bcrypt)
  created_at    DATETIME  DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP

Entity: Investment
  id              INT          AUTO_INCREMENT PK
  user_id         INT          NOT NULL (indexed)
  isin            VARCHAR(12)  NOT NULL (indexed)
  name            VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL (from catalog)
  bank            VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL (from catalog)
  category        VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL (from catalog)
  ticker          VARCHAR(30)  NULLABLE (from catalog, null for mutual funds)
  shares          DECIMAL(15,6) NOT NULL
  purchase_price  DECIMAL(15,6) NOT NULL
  purchase_date   DATE         NOT NULL
  currency        VARCHAR(10)  DEFAULT 'EUR'
  notes           TEXT         NULLABLE
  created_at      DATETIME     NOT NULL
  updated_at      DATETIME     NOT NULL

Entity: FundCatalog
  id            INT          AUTO_INCREMENT PK
  isin          VARCHAR(12)  UNIQUE NOT NULL
  name          VARCHAR(500) NOT NULL
  bank          VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL
  category      VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL
  risk_level    INT          DEFAULT 3
  currency      VARCHAR(10)  DEFAULT 'EUR'
  yahoo_ticker  VARCHAR(30)  NULLABLE
  FULLTEXT INDEX on (name, isin, bank, category)

Entity: Setting
  setting_key   VARCHAR(255) PK
  setting_value TEXT NOT NULL

Entity: FundPrice (cache)
  isin          VARCHAR(12) PK  (FK → fund_catalog)
  price         DECIMAL(15,6) NOT NULL
  currency      VARCHAR(10) DEFAULT 'EUR'
  updated_at    DATETIME NOT NULL (auto-refreshed on fetch)
```

### Environment variables
| Variable | Required | Purpose | Default |
|----------|----------|---------|---------|
| `MYSQL_HOST` | No | MySQL hostname | `127.0.0.1` |
| `MYSQL_PORT` | No | MySQL port | `3306` |
| `MYSQL_USER` | No | MySQL username | `root` |
| `MYSQL_PASSWORD` | No | MySQL password | `""` |
| `MYSQL_DATABASE` | No | MySQL database name | `fondtracker` |
| `PORT` | No | HTTP server port | `3741` |
| `HOST` | No | HTTP server hostname | `127.0.0.1` |
| `JWT_SECRET` | **Production** | HMAC key for JWT signing | `fondtracker-dev-secret-change-in-prod` |
| `WHATSAPP_PHONE` | No (WhatsApp) | Recipient phone number | — |
| `CALLMEBOT_API_KEY` | No (WhatsApp) | CallMeBot API key | — |
| `WHATSAPP_ENABLED` | No | Enable WhatsApp feature | `true` |
| `WHATSAPP_TIMEZONE` | No | Digest timezone | `Europe/Madrid` |
| `WHATSAPP_DIGEST_CRON` | No | Cron expression | `0 9,18 * * *` |
| `NODE_ENV` | No | Production mode | (unset) |
| `SERVER_IDLE_TIMEOUT_SECONDS` | No | Server idle timeout | `60` |

